(2. Why Extension Inspector AI is Unique Over Traditional Extension Managers) Tj
ET

BT
/F2 9.5 Tf
50 585 Td
(• Event-Driven Architecture: 0% idle CPU usage. Background service worker sleeps when inactive.) Tj
ET

BT
/F2 9.5 Tf
50 570 Td
(• No Web Page Script Pollution: Zero React or heavy script injection into visited websites.) Tj
ET

BT
/F2 9.5 Tf
50 555 Td
(• Flagship Extension DNA Engine: Analyzes browser ecosystem as a cohesive system rather than isolated tools.) Tj
ET

BT
/F2 9.5 Tf
50 540 Td
(• Duplicate Feature Detector: Identifies functional redundancy \(e.g. 3 PDF viewers\) & calculates RAM saved.) Tj
ET

BT
/F2 9.5 Tf
50 525 Td
(• Category Conflict Detector: Pinpoints overlapping network hooks \(e.g. multiple ad blockers or password managers\).) Tj
ET

BT
/F2 9.5 Tf
50 510 Td
(• Plain-English Permission Translation: Converts raw Chrome permissions \(<all_urls>, debugger\) to human advice.) Tj
ET

BT
/F2 9.5 Tf
50 495 Td
(• 100% Local & Privacy First: No remote servers, telemetry, or external data tracking.) Tj
ET

BT
/F1 13 Tf
50 470 Td
(3. Core Engine Architecture) Tj
ET

BT
/F2 9.5 Tf
50 450 Td
(• Discovery Engine: Parses manifest specifications, permissions, icons, and host access levels.) Tj
ET

BT
/F2 9.5 Tf
50 435 Td
(• Trust Engine: Calculates explainable Trust Scores \(0-100\) & Grades \(A+ to F\) based on deterministic criteria.) Tj
ET

BT
/F2 9.5 Tf
50 420 Td
(• Behavior Engine: Infers script injection, network interception, cookie reading, and category types.) Tj
ET

BT
/F2 9.5 Tf
50 405 Td
(• Privacy Engine: Evaluates host access reach \(<all_urls>\) and sensitive cookie exposure.) Tj
ET

BT
/F2 9.5 Tf
50 390 Td
(• Performance Engine: Computes estimated RAM memory footprint \(MB\) and startup delay impact \(ms\).) Tj
ET

BT
/F2 9.5 Tf
50 375 Td
(• Recommendation Engine: Provides prioritized 1-click advice \(Disable, Uninstall, Review, Keep\).) Tj
ET

